        ],
        "text": "The Elections Clause of the U.S. Constitution requires each state legislature to prescribe the rules governing federal elections."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Petitioners",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "e790c40f27cfc29a71075410d857d4d414965aaa7a867def746d808999b8c4e0",
