            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 2,
              "start": 2
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Petitioners argue that the Elections Clause vests state legislatures with authority to set rules for federal elections free from restrictions imposed by state law."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "e790c40f27cfc29a71075410d857d4d414965aaa7a867def746d808999b8c4e0",
